# Excluded from the published archive.
#
# `.pubignore` overrides `.gitignore` rather than adding to it, so build output
# has to be listed explicitly: without these two lines the archive grows from a
# few hundred kilobytes to fifteen.
#
# The example's platform folders are scaffolding: they are regenerated by
# `flutter create`, weigh several hundred kilobytes, and no consumer needs them
# to read the gallery. `example/lib` and `example/pubspec.yaml` stay, so the
# example remains readable and runnable after a `flutter create .`.

.github/
build/
.dart_tool/
.dart_tool/**
example/build/
example/.dart_tool/
example/android/
example/ios/
example/linux/
example/macos/
example/windows/
example/web/
example/.metadata
